<!-- ABOUT -->
<section class="section" id="about">
  <div class="section-head">
    <span class="section-num">§ 01 — ABOUT</span>
    <h2><em>Short note.</em></h2>
  </div>

  <div class="about-grid">
    <div class="about-left">
      <div class="meta-block">
        <span class="label">PROGRAM</span>
        <span>B.Tech IT · GGV Aligarh · Central University · 2025</span>
      </div>
      <div class="meta-block">
        <span class="label">CGPA</span>
        <span>7.2 / 10</span>
      </div>
      <div class="meta-block">
        <span class="label">CERTS</span>
        <span>CDAC Noida · Cyber Council of India</span>
      </div>
      <div class="meta-block">
        <span class="label">LANGUAGES</span>
        <span>Java · Python · C++ · JS · HTML · SQL</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-center">
      <p>I care about the <em>unglamorous middle</em> — between "demo works" and "holds up at 3 am."</p>
      <p>I'm the co-founder of <b>Icogon Private Limited</b> (April 2026), where I built an AI platform that generates complete, production-ready websites from a single prompt. Before that, I did cybersecurity internships at <b>CDAC Noida</b> and <b>Cyber Council of India</b>, working on real-world reconnaissance, forensics and vulnerability assessment.</p>
      <p class="signature">— Prashant</p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-right">
      <p>On the AI/ML side: Android malware detection, multi-disease prediction, predictive maintenance with XR, multilingual voice translation, and a Gemini-powered assistant.</p>
      <p>Comfortable shipping full-stack products and training ML models in equal measure. Currently exploring LLM orchestration and AI product design.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

