          Icogon is an AI-powered builder I founded in April 2026. You type
          a single prompt — and it generates a full, production-ready website
          OR mobile app: layout, copy, styling, routing and deployment. It
          handles both web and app generation from the same prompt. Everything
          end-to-end was built by me under Icogon Private Limited. Live at <b>www.icogon.com</b>.
        </p>
